<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91485" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠλᾰωρός</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλωρός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gate-keeper</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.530
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.681
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.747
			</span></i>; of Odysseus in the Wooden Horse, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				201
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνας] πυλαωρούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.69
				</span></i>
			 (quoted ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.22.80
			</span></i>, but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυραωρούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristarch.
				</span></i>
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Πλούτωνος Κέρβερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.319
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλᾰ-</span><i>sorwó-</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρύω</span> (B)) became <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλᾰ-ʽjʼοῥϝ̓ό-,
				πυλᾰορό-, πυλωρό-</span>, then 
				Ep.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλᾰωρό-</span> (with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ω-</span> taken from the 
				contr.
			 form): <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλᾰ-ʽjʼοῥϝ̓ό-</span>
			also became <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλαυρός, πυλευρός</span>
			(qq. v.), and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλαουρός</span> (v.l.
				in
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.681
			</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλαορός</span> (v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				21.530
			</span></i>).)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
